{"g":4,"b":4,"k":"g","q":"Hvad er datid af 'buy'?","o":["bought","buyed","brought","buys"],"a":"bought","r":"'Buy' er uregelmæssig: buy → bought. Pas på: 'brought' er datid af 'bring'."},
