{"g":4,"b":4,"k":"l","q":"Læs: 'Emma was walking home when it started to rain. She didn't have an umbrella, so she ran.' Hvorfor løb Emma?","o":["Hun kom for sent","Hun havde ingen paraply","Hun var bange","Hun skulle nå bussen"],"a":"Hun havde ingen paraply","r":"'She didn't have an umbrella' = hun havde ingen paraply. 'So' = derfor."},
{"g":4,"b":4,"k":"l","q":"Læs: 'The red team scored 3 goals. The blue team scored 5.' Hvem vandt?","o":["det blå hold","det røde hold","uafgjort","det står der ikke"],"a":"det blå hold","r":"Det blå hold scorede flest mål (5 mod 3)."},
{"g":4,"b":4,"k":"l","q":"Læs: 'Jake is saving his pocket money because he wants to buy a new game.' Hvorfor sparer Jake op?","o":["Han vil give en gave","Han skal på ferie","Han har mistet sine penge","Han vil købe et nyt spil"],"a":"Han vil købe et nyt spil","r":"'Saving' betyder sparer op, og 'because' betyder fordi."},
